      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A Psalm of David, when he fled from Absalom his son. LORD, how are they multiplied that trouble me? many ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " they that rise up against me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.3.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.3.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Many ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " who say of my soul, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "There is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " no help for him in God. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.3.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.3.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But thou, O LORD, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "art",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a shield for me; my glory, and the lifter up of my head.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.3.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.3.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I cried to the LORD with my voice, and he heard me from his holy hill. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.3.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.3.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I laid me down and slept; I awaked; for the LORD sustained me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.3.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.3.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will not be afraid of ten thousands of people, that have set ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "themselves",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " against me on all sides.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.3.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.3.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Arise, O LORD; save me, O my God: for thou hast smitten all my enemies ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "upon",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the cheek bone; thou hast broken the teeth of the ungodly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.3.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.3.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Salvation ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "belongeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to the LORD: thy blessing ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon thy people. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
